WEBVTT

00:15.130 --> 00:21.940
Kokoro no mori no naka kimi ni deau koto

00:15.130 --> 00:21.940
I was always dreaming of meeting you

00:16.130 --> 00:22.180
<b>Zettai Shonen</b>

00:21.940 --> 00:26.970
Itsumo yume mitetan da

00:21.940 --> 00:26.970
within my heart’s forest.

00:26.970 --> 00:33.150
Hikari no silhouette sono saki wo mezashite

00:26.970 --> 00:33.150
The silhouette of light guides the way.

00:33.150 --> 00:38.750
Itsuka ai ni furete mitai

00:33.150 --> 00:38.750
One day, I’d like to try and experience love.

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
Kimochi to kotoba niji to mizutamari

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
My feelings and words can be like rainbows and puddles.

00:44.460 --> 00:51.860
Omoiau yasashisa ga michibiku ashita he to

00:44.460 --> 00:51.860
The kindness we share will guide us into tomorrow.

00:51.860 --> 00:57.370
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru kara

00:51.860 --> 00:57.370
With only you here, I can become stronger.

00:57.370 --> 01:03.680
Sora takaku negai wo kanadeyou

00:57.370 --> 01:03.680
My wish will be granted in the heights of the sky.

01:03.680 --> 01:09.050
Nanika taisetsu ka wo miushinawanu you ni

01:03.680 --> 01:09.050
You won’t lose sight of something precious to you,

01:09.050 --> 01:18.330
Kitto motto kagayaku kara

01:09.050 --> 01:18.330
because I’m sure it’ll shine even brighter.

01:18.330 --> 01:23.760
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru no sa

01:18.330 --> 01:23.760
With only you here, I can become stronger.

01:23.760 --> 01:30.140
Ima dekiru koto kara hajimeyou

01:23.760 --> 01:30.140
Let’s start with what we can do right now.

01:30.140 --> 01:35.540
Mawarimichi demo ii jibun wo shinjite

01:30.140 --> 01:35.540
I don’t mind if we take a detour, 
as long as you believe in yourself.

01:35.540 --> 01:44.650
Kitto motto sono saki he to

01:35.540 --> 01:44.650
By doing that, I’m sure we can go even further.

01:54.330 --> 01:57.030
<b>Hana-san, I’ll be heading out for a bit.</b>

02:13.910 --> 02:16.210
<b>Good morning, Sukawara-san!</b>

02:16.210 --> 02:18.350
<b>What shall we do today?</b>

02:19.480 --> 02:22.420
<b>Boy. What happened to school?</b>

02:22.420 --> 02:24.890
<b>That’s that. This is this.</b>

02:24.890 --> 02:27.690
<b>You need to get your priorities straight.</b>

02:28.190 --> 02:30.490
<b>Give me a call when school lets out.</b>

02:30.500 --> 02:32.130
<b>Ehhh?</b>

02:32.130 --> 02:34.130
<b>Don’t “ehhh” me!</b>

02:35.100 --> 02:36.400
<b>Got it?</b>

02:37.700 --> 02:39.900
<b>Yeah...</b>

02:39.910 --> 02:41.270
<b>All right then.</b>

02:44.510 --> 02:45.910
<b>Oh, yeah.</b>

02:45.910 --> 02:48.280
<b>I was wondering if I could
meet with that guy.</b>

02:48.280 --> 02:49.250
<b>Who?</b>

02:49.250 --> 02:53.220
<b>The guy who was with that girl
who had a material evil.</b>

02:53.220 --> 02:55.250
<b>A “material evil”?</b>

02:55.790 --> 02:58.860
<b>Since the warm-colored lights
are material fairies...</b>

02:58.860 --> 03:01.430
<b>...the cold-colored ones will be
material evils.</b>

03:01.430 --> 03:04.030
<b>We need to call them
something, after all.</b>

03:07.530 --> 03:14.510
<b>Material Fairies</b>

03:28.540 --> 03:29.740
<b>No...</b>

03:30.460 --> 03:31.860
<b>No!</b>

