05:05.920 --> 05:07.320
<b>That’s right.</b>

05:07.320 --> 05:09.650
<b>That was the start of everything...</b>

05:21.600 --> 05:23.600
<b>And that’s everything?</b>

05:23.600 --> 05:27.610
<b>Yeah, that’s pretty much the whole
story until she and I met up here.</b>

05:37.620 --> 05:38.920
<b>What is it?</b>

05:40.820 --> 05:42.620
<b>It’s nothing.</b>

05:42.620 --> 05:45.690
<b>What’s wrong?
Did my beauty catch your eye?</b>

05:45.690 --> 05:49.660
<b>I was just thinking that you’ve changed
a bit since we were in Tana.</b>

05:49.660 --> 05:52.600
<b>If I were the same, don’t you think
that in itself would be pretty bad?</b>

05:52.600 --> 05:53.800
<b>You think so?</b>

05:53.800 --> 05:58.100
<b>If someone hasn’t changed,
that means they haven’t grown, right?</b>

05:58.100 --> 06:01.140
<b>I... don’t know.</b>

06:01.140 --> 06:02.570
<b>Get a grip.</b>

06:03.640 --> 06:05.680
<b>Everyone changes.</b>

06:05.680 --> 06:07.750
<b>You can’t stagnate.</b>

06:07.750 --> 06:12.720
<b>As everyone rushes headlong into new
things, they progress forward.</b>

06:12.720 --> 06:16.320
<b>That... might be true, but...</b>

06:16.320 --> 06:19.460
<b>The same way you weren’t
a middle schooler forever...</b>

06:19.460 --> 06:23.290
<b>...I wasn’t going to work for a local TV station forever.</b>

06:23.300 --> 06:27.100
<b>But how can we even investigate them?</b>

06:31.770 --> 06:36.710
<b>I was wondering... if you’d show
me your Dosshiru and Shisshin.</b>

07:01.370 --> 07:03.530
<b>What did you just say?</b>

07:03.540 --> 07:05.000
<b>I can’t.</b>

07:05.000 --> 07:08.240
<b>But they’re proof!</b>

07:08.240 --> 07:09.410
<b>Proof of what?</b>

07:09.410 --> 07:11.680
<b>I told you in Tana.</b>

07:13.380 --> 07:16.680
<b>This world is definitely not closed.</b>

07:16.680 --> 07:21.250
<b>The things we can’t perceive are just
entangled within the many layers...</b>

07:21.250 --> 07:23.750
<b>...and complexly connected to them.</b>

07:23.760 --> 07:26.820
<b>And Dosshiru and Shisshin
are proof of that?</b>

07:26.830 --> 07:30.290
<b>Yes. They both are.</b>

07:30.300 --> 07:35.870
<b>Material fairies are messengers that
come and go between those layers.</b>

07:35.870 --> 07:36.870
<b>I wonder about that...</b>

07:37.840 --> 07:39.540
<b>I think of them a little differently.</b>

07:39.540 --> 07:43.310
<b>At the very least, the material
fairies aren’t messengers.</b>

07:43.310 --> 07:45.310
<b>Then, what do you think they are?</b>

07:46.550 --> 07:47.950
<b>I don’t know...</b>

07:49.950 --> 07:52.520
<b>We’re eyewitnesses to that
event, aren’t we?</b>

07:53.620 --> 07:57.320
<b>What did the evening of the Cat Dance mean to you?</b>

07:57.320 --> 08:02.190
<b>That night, we all undoubtedly became
involved with the Material Fairies.</b>

08:02.190 --> 08:04.360
<b>You don’t deny that, do you?</b>

08:04.360 --> 08:05.460
<b>No...</b>

08:05.460 --> 08:10.530
<b>That’s why we have to read into and decipher
the message they’re trying to tell us.</b>

08:11.740 --> 08:15.570
<b>The warm- and cold-colored fairies.</b>

08:15.570 --> 08:19.240
<b>Right now, their opposing relationship
is trying to become clear to us.</b>

08:19.240 --> 08:25.380
<b>If that’s not a message from beyond
those layers, what is it?</b>

08:25.380 --> 08:26.950
<b>I...</b>

08:29.320 --> 08:31.220
<b>I... what?</b>

08:32.360 --> 08:35.390
<b>I don’t think I’ve been able to act
objectively towards them yet.</b>

08:40.230 --> 08:43.100
<b>Is it because that girl’s on your mind?</b>

08:43.100 --> 08:48.840
<b>Your fairies destroyed her evil,
so you feel indebted to her?</b>

08:48.840 --> 08:50.840
<b>How could I not feel indebted?</b>

08:51.880 --> 08:53.480
<b>I think you’re wasting your time.</b>

08:53.480 --> 08:54.080
<b>Wasting my time?</b>

08:55.780 --> 08:58.920
<b>You’re not the one who destroyed it.</b>

08:58.920 --> 09:03.490
<b>And no one could’ve imagined that
things would turn out like that.</b>

09:03.490 --> 09:05.590
<b>Rather than brooding over something
that’s already happened...</b>

09:05.590 --> 09:09.160
<b>...shouldn’t you try to learn as much
from the results as possible?</b>

09:12.330 --> 09:16.570
<b>Your fairies might’ve destroyed
her evil this time, but...</b>

09:16.570 --> 09:22.010
<b>...there are other eyewitnesses who’ve seen
the evils attacking a single fairy before.</b>

09:23.680 --> 09:26.740
<b>Since we got involved with them,
shouldn’t it be our job...</b>

09:26.750 --> 09:31.420
<b>...to determine what’s going on through
thorough investigation...</b>

09:31.420 --> 09:35.650
<b>...and bring that information to the people?</b>

09:35.650 --> 09:39.290
<b>It might be your job to convey that stuff, but...</b>

09:39.290 --> 09:41.060
<b>...I feel differently, so...</b>

09:41.060 --> 09:45.360
<b>Even so, that doesn’t necessarily mean you
should stop trying to figure them out!</b>

09:45.360 --> 09:47.470
<b>I won’t stop trying!</b>

09:47.470 --> 09:50.000
<b>I won’t stop trying, but...
I don’t feel the same as you.</b>

09:54.370 --> 09:55.970
<b>It really is such a waste, though...</b>

09:56.580 --> 10:00.380
<b>When we have such perfect physical
evidence right before our eyes, too...</b>

10:01.680 --> 10:05.320
<b>They were right before our eyes
back in Tana, you know.</b>

10:17.560 --> 10:19.060
<b>This is impossible...</b>

10:29.370 --> 10:31.440
<b>So it really was you.</b>

10:46.860 --> 10:49.730
<b>That night...</b>

10:49.730 --> 10:53.530
<b>...you looked like you saw something
you shouldn’t have...</b>

10:53.530 --> 10:55.770
<b>...and were standing over there.</b>

10:55.770 --> 11:00.540
<b>If you weren’t there, I don’t think
I could have believed my eyes.</b>

11:02.110 --> 11:05.580
<b>You also saw them, didn’t you?</b>

11:05.580 --> 11:07.450
<b>Are you the one?</b>

11:08.710 --> 11:11.020
<b>“Trust yourself...”</b>

11:11.020 --> 11:14.220
<b>The one who drew that mural in
the underpass at Sakuragi Town.</b>

11:15.990 --> 11:18.320
<b>Huh? Yeah..</b>

11:22.090 --> 11:24.830
<b>Trust yourself, huh?</b>

11:27.770 --> 11:30.970
<b>Because you were there...</b>

11:30.970 --> 11:33.240
<b>When I saw the look on your face...</b>

11:33.240 --> 11:37.340
<b>...I was convinced that what I saw
wasn’t a dream or a delusion.</b>

11:37.340 --> 11:39.810
<b>But I wasn’t sure how you
might feel about it.</b>

11:39.810 --> 11:43.550
<b>You couldn’t have painted the mural
because of that, could you...?</b>

11:43.550 --> 11:46.850
<b>Reason is something that comes
after you do something.</b>

11:46.850 --> 11:49.620
<b>I painted it because I wanted to.</b>

11:49.620 --> 11:51.720
<b>It’s probably nothing more than that.</b>

11:53.020 --> 11:54.460
<b>I...</b>

11:55.230 --> 11:58.430
<b>You pretended you didn’t see it, right?</b>

12:01.270 --> 12:03.130
<b>But...</b>

12:03.140 --> 12:04.940
<b>We both saw it.</b>

12:06.270 --> 12:08.140
<b>No matter how unreasonable something seems...</b>

12:08.140 --> 12:13.340
<b>...if we don’t first accept it, we might
not be able to move forward.</b>

12:13.350 --> 12:15.710
<b>For both you and me.</b>

12:15.710 --> 12:20.180
<b>If I accept it, is there really
something to move forward to?</b>

12:20.190 --> 12:22.950
<b>Trust yourself.</b>

12:43.340 --> 12:45.340
<b>So how’ve things been since we talked last time?</b>

12:48.650 --> 12:51.580
<b>From the look on your face,
I guess you’ve had no progress, huh?</b>

12:52.080 --> 12:54.690
<b>You’re... Miyama-san, right?</b>

12:54.690 --> 12:57.120
<b>You remembered my name.</b>

12:57.120 --> 12:58.890
<b>I’m Miyama Mika.</b>

12:58.890 --> 13:01.130
<b>Why do you tag along with me like this?</b>

13:01.130 --> 13:03.790
<b>I don’t really mean to...</b>

13:04.900 --> 13:08.300
<b>It’s just that I’m interested in what you
and Sukawara are investigating.</b>

13:09.700 --> 13:11.200
<b>It’s a bother, so...</b>

13:12.170 --> 13:14.240
<b>Since it has nothing to do with you.</b>

13:20.910 --> 13:24.180
<b>Why do you keep moping
around like this?</b>

13:24.180 --> 13:27.450
<b>You have no idea how I feel...</b>

13:27.450 --> 13:28.790
<b>You’re right, I don’t.</b>

13:28.790 --> 13:30.420
<b>Because you won’t tell me anything.</b>

13:31.660 --> 13:34.630
<b>I have nothing to say to a stranger.</b>

13:34.630 --> 13:37.930
<b>That means you can talk to people
who aren’t strangers.</b>

13:39.730 --> 13:43.230
<b>But for you... it doesn’t look like
you can talk to either, huh?</b>

13:45.400 --> 13:48.610
<b>You’re fooling yourself if you
think that by staying silent...</b>

13:48.610 --> 13:51.440
<b>...your feelings will reach them someday anyway.</b>

13:51.440 --> 13:54.310
<b>No matter how close a person is to you...</b>

13:54.310 --> 13:58.280
<b>...whether it’s your family, your lover,
or anyone else for that matter...</b>

13:58.280 --> 14:01.920
<b>...if you don’t say what you’re
thinking, they’ll never get it.</b>

14:03.890 --> 14:05.420
<b>Get a grip.</b>

14:18.740 --> 14:20.770
<b>I just can’t seem to leave that boy alone.</b>

