<b>Hello?</b>

15:03.350 --> 15:06.350
<b>I can’t come to the phone right now, but–</b>

15:21.870 --> 15:23.670
<b>Kobayakawa-kun.</b>

15:25.170 --> 15:26.540
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

15:27.410 --> 15:29.540
<b>I found out by looking at the school’s registry...</b>

15:29.540 --> 15:33.110
<b>...and thought, “Yeah, it was somewhere
around here, wasn’t it?”</b>

15:33.110 --> 15:35.810
<b>You were looking up where I lived?</b>

15:35.810 --> 15:36.510
<b>Yeah...</b>

15:39.650 --> 15:41.350
<b>Umm...</b>

15:41.350 --> 15:43.890
<b>Sukawara-san said she
wanted to meet you.</b>

15:43.890 --> 15:44.920
<b>Who’s that?</b>

15:44.920 --> 15:47.260
<b>She’s this woman who wrote a book
called “The Summer of the Fairies.”</b>

15:47.260 --> 15:49.790
<b>She was with me the other day
at Rinkou Park.</b>

15:49.800 --> 15:51.930
<b>What are you?</b>

15:51.930 --> 15:53.560
<b>Her little errand boy or something?</b>

15:53.570 --> 15:56.030
<b>No, but...</b>

15:56.030 --> 15:57.270
<b>Well, I don’t intend to meet her.</b>

15:57.740 --> 15:59.570
<b>It’s stuck in your mind though, isn’t it?</b>

16:01.010 --> 16:01.910
<b>You can tell her...</b>

16:02.370 --> 16:06.180
<b>...I was the one who convinced Kisa
to meet with that Aizawa guy.</b>

16:06.180 --> 16:08.250
<b>It was <i>me</i>.</b>

16:08.250 --> 16:11.220
<b>Had I not said that,
Kisa’s Bun-chan would still be...</b>

16:14.590 --> 16:21.130
<b>Do you understand just how important
Bun-chan was to Kisa?</b>

16:21.130 --> 16:25.860
<b>Can you understand how I feel by being
the one who basically stole it from her?</b>

16:25.860 --> 16:27.100
<b>I can’t...</b>

16:27.100 --> 16:29.400
<b>Then leave me alone.</b>

16:34.340 --> 16:36.310
<b>Come in, come in.</b>

16:45.280 --> 16:47.690
<b>It looks like a war broke out in here...</b>

16:48.190 --> 16:51.420
<b>It’s because I’m always ready to fight.</b>

16:52.820 --> 16:54.860
<b>So, how’d it go?</b>

16:58.330 --> 17:00.530
<b>He doesn’t want to meet me, huh?</b>

17:00.530 --> 17:02.030
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:02.030 --> 17:03.600
<b>Well, there’s nothing I can do about that.</b>

17:03.600 --> 17:06.770
<b>I guess I’ll have to be patient
and wait for him.</b>

17:06.770 --> 17:09.440
<b>Maybe the girl who had the evil...</b>

17:09.440 --> 17:12.740
<b>Umm... Tanigawa Kisa-chan
was her name.</b>

17:12.740 --> 17:13.910
<b>Umm...</b>

17:15.750 --> 17:16.510
<b>What’s the matter?</b>

17:17.080 --> 17:21.750
<b>“Evil” means wicked or sinister...</b>

17:21.750 --> 17:23.650
<b>...or something like that, right?</b>

17:23.660 --> 17:25.460
<b>Yeah...</b>

17:25.460 --> 17:27.690
<b>I wonder if that’s really right...</b>

17:27.690 --> 17:31.100
<b>I don’t know how to put it, but...</b>

17:31.100 --> 17:32.900
<b>I feel some resistance to that name.</b>

17:32.900 --> 17:33.990
<b>Resistance?</b>

17:33.990 --> 17:37.970
<b>I wonder if it’s really okay to declare
them evil so quickly...</b>

17:37.970 --> 17:40.270
<b>I think it’s a fairly good name,
and easy to remember...</b>

17:40.270 --> 17:41.740
<b>But like I’ve been saying...</b>

17:44.040 --> 17:46.410
<b>What is it?</b>

17:46.410 --> 17:47.980
<b>Never mind...</b>

17:47.980 --> 17:50.450
<b>Tanigawa</b>

17:57.920 --> 17:59.220
<b>I’m not here.</b>

17:59.220 --> 18:00.960
<b>No one’s here.</b>

18:00.960 --> 18:02.630
<b>Please go home.</b>

18:02.630 --> 18:04.100
<b>No one’s home.</b>

18:04.100 --> 18:05.460
<b>Please leave.</b>

18:05.460 --> 18:06.600
<b>No one’s here.</b>

18:06.600 --> 18:08.330
<b>No one. No one.</b>

18:18.540 --> 18:20.750
<b>Tanigawa</b>

18:27.720 --> 18:32.060
<b>Rieko-chan, you’re worried about Tanigawa-san, too!</b>

18:32.060 --> 18:33.890
<b>I’m not.</b>

18:33.890 --> 18:34.530
<b>But...</b>

18:34.530 --> 18:38.260
<b>Everyone keeps acting worried and
saying “Kisa this, Kisa that...”</b>

18:38.260 --> 18:39.630
<b>Everyone?</b>

18:39.630 --> 18:41.530
<b>Like Shigeki...</b>

18:41.530 --> 18:45.300
<b>Yet that girl is just keeping herself confined like this.</b>

18:45.300 --> 18:49.010
<b>I just can’t forgive that,
and somehow brought myself here.</b>

18:49.710 --> 18:51.080
<b>You’re mad at her?</b>

18:51.080 --> 18:53.980
<b>Forget it. Things have gotten
out of hand.</b>

18:53.980 --> 18:55.080
<b>Bye.</b>

18:55.080 --> 18:56.610
<b>That’s a lie.</b>

18:56.620 --> 18:58.220
<b>What is?</b>

18:58.220 --> 19:02.790
<b>You’re really worried about her, too.</b>

19:02.790 --> 19:06.390
<b>Makki... you don’t understand.</b>

19:06.390 --> 19:08.990
<b>I don’t think you’d come here out of
the blue if you weren’t worried.</b>

19:08.990 --> 19:11.230
<b>You do have a reason for
coming, don’t you?</b>

19:11.700 --> 19:13.660
<b>Like I said, that’s...</b>

19:15.130 --> 19:17.540
<b>This has nothing to do with you, Makki.</b>

19:17.540 --> 19:18.500
<b>Is that so?</b>

19:18.500 --> 19:19.670
<b>It doesn’t!</b>

19:20.940 --> 19:22.010
<b>Okay.</b>

19:35.390 --> 19:38.460
<b>What am I doing?</b>

19:43.200 --> 19:46.560
<b>Did you talk to Sakakura about Old Lady Okaka?</b>

19:46.570 --> 19:48.800
<b>Yeah, I did.</b>

19:48.800 --> 19:51.300
<b>Did he say anything?</b>

19:51.300 --> 19:54.610
<b>He only said, “Is that so...?”</b>

19:55.810 --> 19:57.210
<b>I see.</b>

19:57.210 --> 20:01.610
<b>But after he said that,
he took right off.</b>

20:01.610 --> 20:05.820
<b>He might have been crying...
or something?</b>

20:06.490 --> 20:08.690
<b>Are you there?</b>

20:08.690 --> 20:10.520
<b>You all right?</b>

20:10.520 --> 20:11.290
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:11.820 --> 20:13.460
<b>Umm...</b>

20:13.460 --> 20:19.800
<b>About the story where Dosshiru and Shisshin
destroyed that girl’s material fairy...</b>

20:19.800 --> 20:23.930
<b>I think you have the choice to do nothing, if you want.</b>

20:23.940 --> 20:24.970
<b>Yeah...</b>

20:26.000 --> 20:29.270
<b>If only I could go there, too...</b>

20:29.270 --> 20:30.670
<b>Thanks.</b>

20:30.680 --> 20:33.080
<b>What’s up with that?</b>

20:33.080 --> 20:35.250
<b>I just felt like I needed to say it.</b>

20:36.350 --> 20:38.580
<b>I’m sure everything’ll be fine.</b>

20:38.580 --> 20:40.120
<b>It’d be great if it were.</b>

20:40.120 --> 20:42.120
<b>I’m going to think over my options.</b>

20:42.120 --> 20:44.360
<b>You can’t brood over this.</b>

20:44.360 --> 20:45.260
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:45.260 --> 20:47.960
<b>If you ever feel frazzled,
you can always call me.</b>

20:47.960 --> 20:49.230
<b>Yeah. Thanks.</b>

20:49.230 --> 20:51.230
<b>I just said...!</b>

20:52.530 --> 20:53.900
<b>Thanks.</b>

20:53.900 --> 20:55.700
<b>Geez!</b>

20:59.770 --> 21:04.410
<b>Kobayakawa-kun, Tanigawa-san, Rieko-chan...</b>

21:04.410 --> 21:06.110
<b>...and me.</b>

21:06.110 --> 21:08.380
<b>We won’t get anywhere if we all just stay like this.</b>

21:11.850 --> 21:13.120
<b>Incoming</b>

21:11.850 --> 21:13.120
<b>Home</b>

21:13.120 --> 21:13.180
<b>Incoming</b>

21:13.120 --> 21:13.180
<b>Home</b>

21:13.180 --> 21:13.280
<b>Incoming</b>

21:13.180 --> 21:13.280
<b>Home</b>

21:22.660 --> 21:25.660
<b>Once we know they exist,
nothing else is surprising.</b>

21:27.530 --> 21:29.230
<b>And they’re not evil.</b>

21:31.670 --> 21:33.170
<b>But...</b>

21:33.170 --> 21:34.670
<b>What are they?</b>

21:36.580 --> 21:37.580
<b>No way!</b>

21:37.580 --> 21:39.940
<b>I’m telling you, it’s the truth! And then...</b>

21:43.050 --> 21:44.450
<b>Huh?</b>

21:45.750 --> 21:47.020
<b>What’s wrong?</b>

21:48.420 --> 21:51.620
<b>I wanted... to talk to you...</b>

21:51.620 --> 21:53.590
<b>Something happen?</b>

21:53.590 --> 21:56.260
<b>Because it was... just like you said...</b>

21:57.360 --> 22:01.430
<b>I hadn’t done anything until now...</b>

22:01.430 --> 22:03.770
<b>But it’s not just me.</b>

22:03.770 --> 22:05.440
<b>Everyone’s the same...</b>

22:05.440 --> 22:10.440
<b>But I was able to realize it
thanks to you, so...</b>

22:10.440 --> 22:11.910
<b>So...</b>

22:11.910 --> 22:14.880
<b>So... I realized we couldn’t all
stay like this.</b>

22:15.950 --> 22:18.150
<b>I just wanted to say that much...</b>

22:18.150 --> 22:19.250
<b>I see.</b>

22:19.250 --> 22:20.380
<b>Yes.</b>

22:20.390 --> 22:22.320
<b>Well then, if you’ll excuse me...</b>

22:37.270 --> 22:38.940
<b>Ah, Miki?</b>

22:38.940 --> 22:40.070
<b>Yeah, it’s me.</b>

22:40.540 --> 22:41.940
<b>Are you free right now?</b>

22:41.940 --> 22:45.610
<b>No, something really good just happened,
and I wanted to talk to someone about it.</b>

22:45.610 --> 22:48.450
<b>You see, there was this boy here who...</b>

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
Daremo shiranai kotoba de kimi he to

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
On that nostalgic hill, I sang out to you

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
Utaikaketa natsukashii oka de

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
words that no one else knew.

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
Tomare soyokaze kawaranu omoide

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
The dying breeze and my unchanged memories

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
Sotto misete ano koro no boku wa

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
gently reveal to me what I was like back then.

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Aa yume wo aishite hitori ni natta

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Ah, I thought that being alone

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
Sore de ii to omotta

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
and cherishing my dream would be fine.

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
Haruka na sora ni wa ima mo kimi ga iru darou

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
I wonder if you’re still there right now in the distant sky?

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Yasashiku ikiru yo afureru namida koraeta

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Now I lead a simple life, having suppressed my overflowing tears.

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
Mirai no melody ga shizuka ni yureru kisetsu

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
The melody of the future is in the quietly stirring seasons.

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
Aitai na itsu no hi ka... mattete

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
I want to see you again, and I’m waiting for that day.

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
Aitai ne boku wa mada humming boy

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
I want to see you again, but I’m still a humming boy.

