<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

24:23.680 --> 24:24.840
<b>I’m so happy...</b>

24:24.840 --> 24:26.640
<b>This must be one of those
“small pieces of happiness” in one’s life.</b>

24:26.650 --> 24:28.280
<b>You really don’t want to
move from here, huh?</b>

24:28.280 --> 24:30.750
<b>Whenever you’re in a heated comforter like
this, you really want to eat oranges, huh?</b>

24:30.750 --> 24:32.420
<b>Here you go.
I prepared them.</b>

24:33.250 --> 24:34.620
<b>Mandarin oranges are fine and all,</b>

24:34.620 --> 24:36.490
<b>but it’s not a good heated comforter without some ice cream.</b>

24:36.490 --> 24:38.390
<b>Here you go.
I prepared some.</b>

24:39.320 --> 24:41.230
<b>As expected of you, Rokkun!</b>

24:41.230 --> 24:44.800
<b>lt’s common sense to prepare everything
before you rest in a heated comforter.</b>

24:44.800 --> 24:45.730
<b>That’s fine and all, but...</b>

24:45.730 --> 24:47.430
<b>If one of us doesn’t do the
next episode preview soon...</b>

